<HR size="1" color="#5d7790">
<FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">
Morning,<P>Well, last night was something I didn't think I'd ever get to do, fight alongside Ghall, Sleethr, and Nef as Lownar.  My new name is kinda hard to get used to, but at least I can still pronounce it the same (low nar) hehe.  Anyway, even though I got nada for exp last night it was fun.  I ended up putting a total of 685pp in the bank last night, and I'm gonna keep farming for cash until I get enough to get my INT up to at least 185'ish.  Once I get closer to 200 INT then it's time to start hitting LGuk for the SMR, Runed Cowl, and such.  It sounds like Curastik still wants one, so I think he and I are going to head down there sometime in the near future.  I can solo the spawn, so with an additional necro we should be pretty safe, but the more the merrier.  If we could get someone to pull for us, and a healer to join us, we should be able to make some pretty decent exp down there for all the 53 and under folks that show up.  We could possibly get a couple yaks/ssbs, and not to mention, all the serpentine bracers you can shake a stick at.<P>I'm also looking forward to hitting Velks Lab with you guys, I haven't been there yet.  Since you are all on dorf faction and I'm currently allied with Giants and KOS to dorfs, I guess I have some faction work to do also.  bleh  Guess I'll have to spend some time in GD killing giants and wolves.  Sheesh, so much to do. hehe  Almost feels like being a newbie again, except being a level 54 newbie has its advantages. :P  <P>Thanks again for all the gear that everyone has gathered up for me, the nightshade wreath is particularly nice.  As of right now I'm wearing the following:<P>Nightshade Wreath<BR>Nobles Robe<BR>Shadowbound Gloves<BR>Harvester<BR>Stein of Moggok<BR>Damask Arms<BR>Cold Ring (something like that)<P>Not sure if I'll be online tonight, but if I am, be sure to welcome me with a Price Check (bastards).<P>--------------------<P>Lownar Baardeth - 55th Level Gnecromancer<BR>Kalaan - 30th Level Rogue<BR>Rakasak Smakatak - 21st Level Monk<BR>Bertox. Server
</FONT>
